  institution={Quantitative Imaging Biomarkers in Medicine (Quibim S.L.), Aragon Avenue, 30, 13th floor, Office I-J, 46021, Valencia, Spain. anajimenez@quibim.com.; Quantitative Imaging Biomarkers in Medicine (Quibim S.L.), Aragon Avenue, 30, 13th floor, Office I-J, 46021, Valencia, Spain.; Intelligent Data Analysis Laboratory (IDAL), ETSE, Universidad de Valencia, Valencia, Spain.; Quantitative Imaging Biomarkers in Medicine (Quibim S.L.), Aragon Avenue, 30, 13th floor, Office I-J, 46021, Valencia, Spain.; Quantitative Imaging Biomarkers in Medicine (Quibim S.L.), Aragon Avenue, 30, 13th floor, Office I-J, 46021, Valencia, Spain.; Quantitative Imaging Biomarkers in Medicine (Quibim S.L.), Aragon Avenue, 30, 13th floor, Office I-J, 46021, Valencia, Spain.; Department of Radiology and GIBI230 Research Group On Biomedical Imaging, Hospital Universitario Y Politécnico de La Fe and Instituto de Investigación Sanitaria La Fe, Valencia, Spain.; Department of Radiology and GIBI230 Research Group On Biomedical Imaging, Hospital Universitario Y Politécnico de La Fe and Instituto de Investigación Sanitaria La Fe, Valencia, Spain.; Centro Uruguayo de Imagenologia Molecular (CUDIM), Montevideo, Uruguay.; Centro Uruguayo de Imagenologia Molecular (CUDIM), Montevideo, Uruguay.; Centro Uruguayo de Imagenologia Molecular (CUDIM), Montevideo, Uruguay.; University Hospitals Cleveland Medical Center, Cleveland, USA.; DasaInova, Dasa, Unifesp, São Paulo, Brazil.; DasaInova, Dasa, Unifesp, São Paulo, Brazil.; Mahajan Imaging, New Delhi, India.; Mahajan Imaging, New Delhi, India.; Stony Brook University, Stony Brook, NY, USA.; Intelligent Data Analysis Laboratory (IDAL), ETSE, Universidad de Valencia, Valencia, Spain.; Quantitative Imaging Biomarkers in Medicine (Quibim S.L.), Aragon Avenue, 30, 13th floor, Office I-J, 46021, Valencia, Spain.},
